        "answer": {
          "short": "$2x+1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{x+1}}{\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{x+1}}&=\\frac{\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{x+1}}{\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{x+1}}\\times\\frac{x(x+1)}{x(x+1)}\\\\&=\\frac{(x+1)+x}{(x+1)-x}\\\\&=\\frac{2x+1}{1}\\\\&=2x+1\\end{align*}$$",
